// Stream-switch routes for projection broadcast and attention replay.
// Each projection column serves its four compute rows. Route ownership also
// covers control packets and the memory-tile paths used by attention panels.
// Configuration executes while the array is reset, before any queue starts.
target.decl @qwen3_embedding.panels.configuration

